1
00:00:23,776 --> 00:00:28,515
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,515 --> 00:00:32,227
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,451 --> 00:00:34,696
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,043 --> 00:00:37,750
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,629 --> 00:00:43,157
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,157 --> 00:00:46,789
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,267 --> 00:00:50,755
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,899 --> 00:00:55,395
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,395 --> 00:01:00,035
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,423 --> 00:01:02,083
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,083 --> 00:01:08,035
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,227 --> 00:01:11,915
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,915 --> 00:01:15,486
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,651 --> 00:01:22,595
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,043 --> 00:01:26,664
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,664 --> 00:01:30,348
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,435 --> 00:01:35,363
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,363 --> 00:01:39,523
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,267 --> 00:01:46,819
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,363 --> 00:01:50,019
=Episode 3=

21
00:02:18,439 --> 00:02:20,240
Why isn't Mr. Hu back yet?

22
00:02:20,759 --> 00:02:23,599
He probably snuck off
to some maid's room.

23
00:02:52,448 --> 00:03:24,736
♪A riot of colors on the walls,
bright and low♪

24
00:03:28,599 --> 00:03:29,240
Stop.

25
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,199
Now...

26
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:35,120
Isn't it Mr. Rong's turn to perform now?
Why isn't he here yet?

27
00:03:36,719 --> 00:03:38,599
(It seems Rong Xiaonan really fled.)

28
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:42,360
(I shed your blood on my blade.)

29
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:46,240
(The real play is about to begin.)

30
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:52,680
Where is Rong Xiaonan?

31
00:03:54,599 --> 00:03:58,599
What is this?
What game are you playing with me?

32
00:04:06,479 --> 00:04:07,240
(Mr. Rong?)

33
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:13,919
Switching roles.

34
00:04:14,719 --> 00:04:16,800
It seems
they put some thought into this.

35
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,279
Sir!

36
00:04:51,079 --> 00:04:52,560
You're startling the guests.

37
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:53,519
What's going on?

38
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:56,864
Mr. Hu is found dead
in the Young Marshal's room.

39
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,399
What?

40
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:18,399
(He didn't flee, so he can frame me.)

41
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:31,136
(Let this drop of blood
be the first offering to Master.)

42
00:05:33,248 --> 00:05:39,800
(For the massacre of the whole troupe,
I will make you all pay in blood.)

43
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:56,959
The guards have surrounded the mansion.
No one is allowed in or out.

44
00:05:57,240 --> 00:06:00,920
Everyone inside is ordered to stay put.
No one can move around.

45
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:05,920
Mr. Qian,

46
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,399
rest assured.

47
00:06:07,759 --> 00:06:09,639
I will definitely find the murderer.

48
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:14,519
As long as the murderer is still
in here, they will never escape.

49
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:25,079
He died in your room.

50
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:28,319
During the noon banquet,
you were the only one absent.

51
00:06:34,079 --> 00:06:38,959
You Xiaosheng Society
don't have a say in here.

52
00:06:39,136 --> 00:06:43,920
If you want to kill me,
you should first know your place.

53
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,040
It wasn't Young Marshal.

54
00:06:47,079 --> 00:06:48,480
I heard someone singing.

55
00:06:50,079 --> 00:06:52,600
He was probably drawn there
by the sound of opera singing.

56
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,600
It was him.

57
00:06:55,759 --> 00:06:56,560
No.

58
00:06:56,839 --> 00:06:57,839
It wasn't Mr. Rong.

59
00:06:58,199 --> 00:07:00,920
We've been together all the time.
He couldn't kill anyone.

60
00:07:01,839 --> 00:07:03,680
Take Miss Jiang away.

61
00:07:03,959 --> 00:07:04,480
- Yes!
- Yes!

62
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:07,160
Don't touch me! Let go of me!

63
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,240
It wasn't Mr. Rong.

64
00:07:08,399 --> 00:07:09,480
- It's fine.
- Not him.

65
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,959
- Mr. Rong.
- Go.

66
00:07:13,439 --> 00:07:14,240
Adjutant Sun,

67
00:07:14,839 --> 00:07:16,800
when exactly did you hear
the opera singing?

68
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,240
At his...

69
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:23,360
Just tell the truth.
What tricks are you pulling?

70
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,439
No matter who did it,

71
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:32,519
a man of Xiaosheng Society died here,

72
00:07:32,704 --> 00:07:39,680
so everyone present
will be buried with him.

73
00:08:02,279 --> 00:08:04,399
(He dared kill someone
from Xiaosheng Society?)

74
00:08:24,399 --> 00:08:25,879
You want to save him?

75
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:33,480
If we want to recover
the Jade Buddha Head, he can't die yet.

76
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:38,304
Now that the Xiaosheng Society people
died in the mansion,

77
00:08:38,304 --> 00:08:41,679
neither of us can escape the blame.

78
00:08:43,168 --> 00:08:48,360
If you don't want to be buried with him,
this is the only way out.

79
00:08:58,679 --> 00:09:01,799
Escort these two guests
out of the Governor Mansion,

80
00:09:02,639 --> 00:09:04,240
to the bandits outside the city.

81
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,679
Make it clean and quick.

82
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:07,879
Yes.

83
00:09:08,679 --> 00:09:11,440
If anyone spreads a word
of what happened today,

84
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:16,279
I bet you know the consequences.

85
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:45,799
It was made
to look like a bandit ambush.

86
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:48,240
Those bandits were dealt with as well.

87
00:09:49,399 --> 00:09:51,279
The deaths
of those two Xiaosheng Society men

88
00:09:53,759 --> 00:10:00,279
caused me trouble, but helped cover up
the theft of the Jade Buddha Head.

89
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:04,120
Did you find the Jade Buddha Head?

90
00:10:05,408 --> 00:10:06,600
I have failed you.

91
00:10:07,039 --> 00:10:12,679
We've thoroughly searched every place
Rong Huaiqiu visited, but found nothing.

92
00:10:14,016 --> 00:10:16,480
I have some suspicions.

93
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:23,600
The artifacts in this chest
were tampered with earlier.

94
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:28,679
I investigated. It seems Young Marshal
once visited the west wing rooms.

95
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:33,279
He has been in frequent contact
with Rong Xiaonan.

96
00:10:33,879 --> 00:10:35,720
Considering all these recent incidents,

97
00:10:36,519 --> 00:10:40,416
I suspect the theft
of the Jade Buddha Head

98
00:10:40,416 --> 00:10:42,679
might have been connected
to Young Marshal all along.

99
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:48,080
Should we arrest Rong Xiaonan
and interrogate him thoroughly?

100
00:10:48,399 --> 00:10:49,240
No need.

101
00:10:50,799 --> 00:10:55,744
Rather than alerting them, it's better
to let them dig their own graves.

102
00:11:09,039 --> 00:11:10,879
It's a dog I raised with my own hands.

103
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:18,496
I really don't want to kill him yet.

104
00:11:30,519 --> 00:11:34,320
In the vision, Master called
the murderer "Lackey".

105
00:11:34,919 --> 00:11:35,840
But today,

106
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:39,220
judging by how Xu You'an
treated the Xiaosheng Society,

107
00:11:39,456 --> 00:11:41,440
he doesn't seem
to be conspiring with them.

108
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:47,679
Could it be that the one
who murdered Master isn't Xu You'an?

109
00:12:15,968 --> 00:12:17,248
♪As if it were fate♪

110
00:12:17,248 --> 00:12:18,816
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

111
00:12:19,167 --> 00:12:22,404
♪We miss each other♪

112
00:12:23,648 --> 00:12:25,216
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

113
00:12:25,216 --> 00:12:27,616
♪And a bizarre♪

114
00:12:27,616 --> 00:12:30,418
♪Anonymous legend♪

115
00:12:30,948 --> 00:12:32,960
♪The plot twists and turns♪

116
00:12:33,108 --> 00:12:34,848
♪Play out over and over again♪

117
00:12:34,848 --> 00:12:37,912
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

118
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:40,192
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

119
00:12:40,192 --> 00:12:41,184
♪Refuse to submit♪

120
00:12:41,184 --> 00:12:44,384
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

121
00:12:46,048 --> 00:12:48,960
♪There are always too many♪

122
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:50,848
♪Helpless situations♪

123
00:12:50,848 --> 00:12:53,472
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

124
00:12:54,603 --> 00:12:56,563
♪Even if I have questions♪

125
00:12:56,563 --> 00:12:58,563
♪I harbor desires♪

126
00:12:58,563 --> 00:13:01,440
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

127
00:13:01,791 --> 00:13:03,424
♪People come and go♪

128
00:13:03,424 --> 00:13:06,240
♪I'm still all alone♪

129
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:08,968
♪Wandering around♪

130
00:13:09,216 --> 00:13:12,069
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

131
00:13:12,069 --> 00:13:16,530
♪Go through the entanglement♪

132
00:13:16,896 --> 00:13:18,624
♪If longing♪

133
00:13:18,624 --> 00:13:21,783
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

134
00:13:21,783 --> 00:13:24,538
♪How can I be at ease♪

135
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:26,954
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

136
00:13:27,072 --> 00:13:28,928
♪And travelled around the world♪

137
00:13:29,024 --> 00:13:32,112
♪Scars all over me♪

138
00:13:32,384 --> 00:13:35,296
♪If longing never fades♪

139
00:13:35,296 --> 00:13:36,745
♪Burns still hot♪

140
00:13:36,745 --> 00:13:39,824
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

141
00:13:40,096 --> 00:13:41,953
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

142
00:13:42,016 --> 00:13:43,200
♪In the next life♪

143
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:47,680
♪Entangle with you again♪
